Helm Chart Testing
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the importance of testing Helm charts in Kubernetes deployments
Set up and configure Helm test hooks for automated chart validation
Create comprehensive test scenarios for custom Helm charts
Execute and interpret test results to ensure chart reliability
Implement best practices for Helm chart testing workflows
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with YAML syntax and structure
Basic command-line interface experience
Understanding of containerization concepts
Previous exposure to Helm package manager fundamentals
